<metadata><name>Snowlands 0308 Sugar Bowl to Palisades Tahoe</name><desc>one way. 11.3 miles one-way. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/03/0308_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
